    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "##An AI saw mostly wizards in pointy hats. So it usually draws them that way.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-cfu-test-dc2d6114-2f43-46a4-8389-30bfb222a4cc",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "**True**",
            "x": 34,
            "y": 70,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-cfu-test-8f04b86f-d177-4024-9aa3-431ef727d468",
            "width": 26
          },
          {
            "text": "**False**",
            "x": 72,
            "y": 70,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-cfu-test-6be19a10-f6bb-4abe-93d8-7a232047913c",
            "width": 25
          }
        ],
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "True: **Yes!** The AI usually makes what it saw the most.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-cfu-test-8f04b86f-d177-4024-9aa3-431ef727d468",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "Next",
            "x": 50,
            "y": 74,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-cfu-test-7185db35-3d6c-498a-b50a-9023865364ba"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "**Not quite.** The AI learned from lots of pictures, so it usually makes what it saw the most.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-cfu-test-6be19a10-f6bb-4abe-93d8-7a232047913c",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "Next",
            "x": 50,
            "y": 74,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-cfu-test-7185db35-3d6c-498a-b50a-9023865364ba"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "\"An AI picture is a photo of something that really exists.\" (false)\n\n--> True: **Not quite.** The AI makes a new picture from patterns it learned. It isn't a photo of a real thing.\n\n--> False: **Yes!** The AI makes the picture up from patterns, so it can look real without being real.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-cfu-test-7185db35-3d6c-498a-b50a-9023865364ba",
        "links": [
          {
            "text": "",
            "x": 50,
            "y": 50,
            "targetKey": "HoAI26-How-cfu-test-60653286-11b2-4499-a089-8cfc192bcf31"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "\"If I ask an AI for 'a dragon' and don't say what color, it picks a color for me.\" (true)\n\n--> True: **Yes!** When you leave something out, the AI fills it in with what's common. Notice what it chose.\n\n--> False: **Not quite.** The AI fills in whatever you leave out, usually with what's common. That's why it's worth noticing.",
        "imageUrl": "",
        "key": "HoAI26-How-cfu-test-60653286-11b2-4499-a089-8cfc192bcf31",
        "showContinueButton": true
      }
    ],
